/-!
# A115756

Triangle where a(1,1)=1. a(n,m) = number of terms among first (n-1) terms of sequence A115757 which are coprime to m. A115757(n) is the sum of terms in the n-th row of triangle A115756.

The 97 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A115756

